WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.208
Muthassi's stories used to fill the house in Palakkad.

2
00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:06.917
Now her grandchildren grow up in Munich, and her voice is fading.

3
00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:08.722
Kin keeps it.

4
00:00:08.722 --> 00:00:13.833
Every person gets a lifetime timeline: voice, photos, stories, places.

5
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:17.833
Each timeline joins a family tree you can walk across generations.

6
00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:23.292
No smartphone? Meera, the family admin, adds Muthassi by phone.

7
00:00:23.542 --> 00:00:27.500
Memory templates guide every recording: 'Tell us about your wedding day.

8
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.959
One consent, given upfront. Never sold.

9
00:00:31.959 --> 00:00:34.500
Sharing beyond family needs a separate yes.

10
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:40.458
Bonds grow their own shapes: root braids, lotus knots, sibling branches, banyan roots.

11
00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.439
Pets belong too.

12
00:00:42.439 --> 00:00:48.667
Kannan, the dog at Muthassi's feet, gets his own timeline, bark and all, joined by a paw sprout.

13
00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:53.667
Adoption day. First job. Proud moments bloom gold.

14
00:00:53.917 --> 00:01:00.917
For Amma and Achan's fortieth, cousins secretly add memories, Kannan included, anonymous until the gift box opens.

15
00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:04.708
Share one link. Relatives add their own branch.

16
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:08.542
In Munich, Anu taps play, and hears Muthassi again.

17
00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:13.316
Kin. Plant your family's tree. Join the waitlist.

